Implements a TypeScript React application for digitizing farmer-level agricultural data as part of the Climate Smart Irrigated Agriculture Project (CSIAP).

## Authentication & Authorization
- JWT-based login with token storage in localStorage
- Automatic token refresh on 401 responses via Axios interceptors
- Protected route wrapper for authenticated pages
- Auth context provider for global state

## Farmer Management
- CRUD operations with search by NIC/name
- Detail view linking to associated agricultural data
- Service layer pattern for API integration

## Agricultural Data Entry Forms
Five form modules link data to selected farmers:
- Equipment tracking
- Home Garden management  
- CSA Agriculture records
- Agro Well information
- Poultry Farming records

## Validation & Error Handling
Custom validators for:
- Sri Lankan NIC formats (9-digit+V/X and 12-digit)
- Sri Lankan phone numbers (+94XXXXXXXXX or 0XXXXXXXXX)
- Email, dates, required fields, numeric ranges

Form-level validation with inline error messages and API error handling.

## Technical Architecture
```typescript
// Service layer with type-safe API integration
class FarmerService {
  async searchFarmers(query: string): Promise<Farmer[]> {
    const response = await apiService.get<ApiResponse<Farmer[]>>(
      `${API_ENDPOINTS.FARMERS.SEARCH}?q=${encodeURIComponent(query)}`
    );
    return response.data || [];
  }
}

// JWT interceptor for automatic token injection
this.axiosInstance.interceptors.request.use((config) => {
  const token = authService.getToken();
  if (token && config.headers) {
    config.headers.Authorization = `Bearer ${token}`;
  }
  return config;
});
```

API base URL configurable via `REACT_APP_API_BASE_URL` environment variable. Integrates with backend at https://github.com/Climate-Smart-Agriculture/Farmer-Data-System-Api.

## Project Structure
- `components/`: React components organized by domain (auth, farmer, forms, common)
- `services/`: API service layer with typed interfaces
- `types/`: TypeScript definitions for all domain models
- `utils/`: Validation and utility functions
- `contexts/`: React Context providers

Responsive design with CSS custom properties for breakpoints. No UI framework dependencies.

